Adapted code includes:
- Per-compilation derived schema storage follows the value admission/lifetimes
  of JsonConstraintCompiler::Store at the independent Gufo pin below. The
  first-party C17 json_store implementation owns native root identity tables,
  cumulative bounds and retirement; transform/normalization staging uses the
  same contract. Typed views/errors remain private adapters. Two exact
  schema-store-edits.json guards retain original OFF compiler algorithms.
  No DS4, sibling source, model payload or external collection code is imported.
- Root schema admission in src/schema_root.c follows JsonConstraintCompiler::Compile
  at independently fetched immutable Gufo f783fedb9bea2ec7de941f6da4e02f4a4596b29e
  (MIT; gufo-LICENSE retained). C17 owns ordered root-reference traversal,
  cycle identities and scratch retirement, resolved-root type/anyOf validation,
  original-schema Visit admission and whitespace/body root construction.
  Bounded identity storage and a shared whole-chain work budget are first-party
  policy. Private JSON views, prompt text and exceptions remain adapters.
  schema-root-edits.json records two exact default-ON/OFF replacements; original
  OFF root admission is retained. No DS4 or sibling source/artifact is imported.
- Binary64 number formatting/parsing now uses the shared first-party C17
  lie/binary64.h contract, with separately pinned Ryu C material as described
  in ryu-NOTICE. binary64-edits.json keeps both exact original OFF conversions
  in Gufo JSON values. Borrowed JSON trees, lexer/storage and exceptions remain
  private; binary64 conversion belongs to C17. No GCC/libstdc++ implementation,
  DS4 code, sibling artifacts or model payloads are imported.
- Immutable reasoning/tool grammar composition in src/grammar_composition.c
  follows JsonConstraint::WithReasoning/WithTools and JSON name escaping at
  independently fetched immutable Gufo f783fedb9bea2ec7de941f6da4e02f4a4596b29e
  (MIT; gufo-LICENSE retained). C17 owns ordered marker automata, alternatives,
  identity imports/remapping, quoting and stop policy. Typed template/predicate
  storage stays private. composition-edits.json records three exact edits and
  preserves both original OFF algorithms. No DS4/sibling code or artifacts
  are imported. Matching GPU qualification/cost remains separate.
- Ordered reasoning/tool composition cache policy in src/ordered_cache.c follows
  JsonConstraint::WithReasoning/WithTools at independently fetched immutable pin
