Snapshot read/write bridge extraction
------------------------------------
The additive snapshot reader/writer ABI in include/lie/grammar.h and
src/grammar.c extends the attributed official Gufo f783fedb C17 state port.
C owns import traversal/construction, export planning, capacity/overlap
validation and copied payloads; adapter gufo_grammar.hpp supplies only typed
container views/growth and nonthrowing error translation. Its original
private vector/string State layout remains; this is not full provider/model
storage ownership or C++ dependency removal. No sibling CachyOS/DS4 source
or artifact is imported. Synthetic host lifetimes/refusal/full-payload tests
are not original-weight GPU correctness/resources/performance qualification.

Concrete grammar construction extraction
---------------------------------------
The rule/class/literal/repetition, JSON byte primitive, generic-value,
shared-prefix unsigned interval and productive/nullable/cycle/pruning algorithms
in src/grammar_builder.c are attributed C17 ports of the independently pinned
official Gufo f783fedb JsonConstraintCompiler. The iterative cycle stack and
owned construction/flat-table lifetimes use the public model-neutral contract
in include/lie/grammar_builder.h. Adapter gufo_grammar_builder.hpp translates
typed views/errors and preserves private reasoning/tool composition templates.
JSON Schema visitor orchestration and binary-double leaf translation remain
transitional; transformations/finite values/reference memo/compile cache and
type/ordered-route policy now use C17.
This is not full compiler,
provider/model storage ownership or C++ dependency removal. No DS4 or sibling
CachyOS source/artifact is imported. Host language/lifetime/refusal witnesses
do not qualify original-weight GPU numerical/resource/performance behavior.

